+
+Parsing: reads the request line, headers and any Content-Length body (waits for the full body). Malformed requests (bad request line or header, invalid Content-Length, Transfer-Encoding, oversized head or body, truncated request) get 400 Bad Request.
+
+Routes: `/` and `/users/:id/posts/:id` (GET only), and `/echo` (any method) which replies with the method and path as text/plain.
